E
rebel flyer paper~
Wake up, Citizens of Bazabel! You are being lied to, and have been lied to
for generations! The Hajagn dynasty is a fraud! These men are not
hero's, they are killers! They have enslaved hundreds of races!
They have slaughtered thousands! Your sons, your fathers, they are
dying in a war that has no reason! The ghouls and elves have done
nothing but aid us! The orcs, trolls, ogres, they are not animals! They
have souls! Rise up, stop this war, stop this enslavement, free
yourself!
~
