#6036
The Trader's Office~
This must be the administrative offices responsible for the Trader's Market.
You can see numerous people waiting in line to obtain the proper paperwork to
open a stall or participate in one of the swapmeets.  It seems that all items
must be approved for sale before one can obtain a permit.
~
