#6039
The Trader's Office~
This is the office of the Minister of Trade. He is currently looking through
different requests for a vendor space or participation in one of the
swapmeets.  The office is neatly organized with several large cabinets filled
with papers.  It seems this man also keeps track on how much money each vendor
is generating in order to properly tax them.
~
0 0 0 0 0 0
D3
Exit description~
~
