#6045
The Jao Estate~
This home is beautiful.  The floor is a solid and highly polished wood and is
covered in beautiful tapestries and fur rugs.  The walls are adorned with
paintings and ancient weapons that must have been in this family for
generations. They must truly be a very wealthy family.
~
