#6054
The Ngyen Estate~
This home is actually somewhat bare when compared to the sheer size of the
property. The floor is made of a solid wood and there are numerous signs of
well but it is not nearly as lavishly decorated as some. Perhaps the family
spent all of their wealth on purchasing this fine house and can not afford to
fill it with lavish things.
~
