#6068
The Yang Gate~
This gate is just as massive as the others.  The thick iron door could resist
any attack.  Numerous guards are patrolling but there is not as much traffic
coming in and out of the gate as the others.  The road that leaves to the
south is not paved but rather hard packed dirt. It does not seem to be
travelled as often.
~
