#6086
A Small Training Dojo~
This dojo is where the guardians of Bazabel are trained.  The floor is
slightly padded and numerous pictures of the Warlord Zanzen and what appears
to be his son adorn the walls. There are also several "inspirational" scrolls
posted along the walls such as "Fear is dishonor" and "Failure is damnation".
~
