The Officer Barrack~
These barracks are by far much more comfortable than the others.  Each officer
has their own room complete with a dresser for their clothes, a couch for
relaxing or reading, and a full sized bed with a cotton mattress and several
pillows. Apparently soldiers are rewarded with luxury in this army.
~
