#6129
A Dirty Shop~
This shop seems to sell a bit of everything. You see some cheap but effective
weapons, some run-down armor, and even a few basic supplies.  The floor is
covered in dirt and the windows have all had their glass broken out from rocks
or stray arrows.  The heavy-set man behind the counter watches you closely
while he sharpens a dagger.
~
